## Project Name :- Manufacturing Lead-Time Prediction 

## Domain : Manufacturing
- Objective: Predict production lead time using order details, production capacity, stock availability, machine information, and other production-related features.
- Dataset: 100,000 synthetic manufacturing records.

## Key Activities :
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Feature engineering
- Encoding categorical variables
- Building a Random Forest Regression model
- Evaluating predictions using MAE, MSE, RMSE, and R²
- Saving the trained model for future predictions

## Tools & Technologies :
- Python
- Pandas and NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Joblib

## Skills Demonstrated :
- Data Preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Feature Engineering
- Regression
- Classification
- Clustering
- Model Evaluation
- Machine Learning Pipelines
- Model Saving and Reuse

## Learning Goals :
- To develop practical Machine Learning skills by working on real world style datasets and solving problems in production domains.
